{
  "$format": "janus-conformance-case/1",
  "id": "facade/pact-jvm-messages",
  "category": "facade",
  "facade": "pact-jvm",
  "title": "pact-jvm's message pacts are handed to the test as a List<Message>, a MessagePact or a V4 pact's messages, with no mock, and recorded as their pacts convert.",
  "covers": [],
  "rows": [
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`@Pact(consumer, provider)` on a method taking `PactDslWithProvider` or `MessagePactBuilder`, returning `RequestResponsePact`, `MessagePact` or `V4Pact`"
    },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "A message test's `List<Message>` (a V4 pact's `List<V4Interaction.AsynchronousMessage>`), `MessagePact` or `V4Pact`"
    },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`MessagePactBuilder`: `consumer`, `hasPactWith`, `given`, `expectsToReceive`, `withContent` (a `DslPart`, a `PactXmlBuilder`, or a `String` with a content type), `withMetadata` (a `Map` or a `MetadataBuilder`)"
    },
    { "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md", "row": "A message's `contentType` metadata" }
  ],
  "why": "consumer-test-migration.md, pact-jvm: a message test's `List<Message>`, `MessagePact` or a V4 pact's messages are the same, each message as its builder built it, and no mock is started (ADR 0067); `MessagePactBuilder`'s calls are the same, a V3 message pact's unless `pactVersion` says otherwise; a message's `contentType` metadata is compared as a media type (ADR 0071).",
  "subjects": { "jvm": "PactJvmMessages.java" },
  "expect": {
    "tests": [
      { "test": "aListOfMessages" },
      { "test": "aMessagePact" },
      { "test": "anXmlMessage" },
      { "test": "aV4PactsMessages" }
    ],
    "contracts": {
      "web-app-orders-events.janus.json": {
        "content": {
          "interactions": [
            {
              "description": "an order label",
              "parts": {
                "message": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": {
                      "label": {
                        "members": {
                          "#trimmed": { "shape": "forbidden" },
                          "sku": {
                            "entries": [
                              {
                                "members": { "#trimmed": { "example": "A-1", "shape": "equality" } },
                                "shape": "object"
                              }
                            ],
                            "shape": "array"
                          }
                        },
                        "shape": "object"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "members": {
                      "contentType": { "shape": "http:media-type", "type": "application/xml", "example": "application/xml" }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "an order note",
              "parts": {
                "message": {
                  "body": { "example": "call before delivery", "shape": "equality" },
                  "metadata": {
                    "members": {
                      "contentType": { "shape": "http:media-type", "type": "text/plain", "example": "text/plain" },
                      "queue": { "example": "notes", "shape": "equality" }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "an order placed event",
              "states": [{ "name": "an order was placed", "params": { "id": 1 } }],
              "parts": {
                "message": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": {
                      "id": { "example": 1, "shape": "integer" },
                      "sku": { "example": "A-1", "shape": "type" }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "members": {
                      "contentType": {
                        "shape": "http:media-type",
                        "type": "application/json; charset=UTF-8",
                        "example": "application/json; charset=UTF-8"
                      },
                      "topic": { "example": "orders", "shape": "equality" }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "an order shipped event",
              "parts": {
                "message": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": { "status": { "example": "shipped", "shape": "equality" } },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "members": {
                      "contentType": {
                        "shape": "http:media-type",
                        "type": "application/json",
                        "example": "application/json"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
